WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.360
Colonel: What the hell is going on?

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.520
Where's Celine?

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.360
George: She's gone, and so is everyone else.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.280
Detective: Wait a minute, where the hell do you think you're going?!

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.300
George: Away from here! This place is cursed!

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.580
If you'd half a brain, you'd all do the same.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.420
Colonel: Don't walk away from me! Where's Celine? Where's Damien!?

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:32.820
Chef: I've spent 25 years cooking for these uppity fucks. I'm not about to die for 'em! I quit!

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:33.680
Bitch!

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:40.920
Butler: I know things seem far beyond your control right now, but such that it is for all of us here.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:45.200
I shall take my leave, and I implore you to do the same.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:51.540
Colonel I won't let my friends die in this godforsaken house!

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:57.740
And if you all are too much of a coward to do the same, you had best leave before I kill you myself!

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.720
Detective: Now you hold on a second, I've got more questions–

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:00.960
Colonel: Get your hands off me!

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.600
Detective: What the hell is going on here?!

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:07.360
Butler: I know he's in pain and I know you might be, too...

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.220
But we need to leave this place.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.660
There's only death here now.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:16.060
[music fades, distorts, sound of a heartbeat echos]

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.200
(whispered) Hey!

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:19.500
(whispered) Help!

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:20.560
(distorted) Madness!

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:23.200
(distorted) You wanna talk about madness?

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:28.460
(distorted) Madness is stealing your best friend's wife.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:30.220
(distorted) Be careful.

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:36.960
(distorted) Now this evening, it's not all about the poker; it's not all about me.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:42.820
(distorted) Can't we resolve this amicably?

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:46.740
(distorted) Life needs a bit of madness, eh, chap?

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:50.000
(distorted) Good to let the beast out every once in a while, eh, old friend?

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:57.500
(distorted) I'm not gonna just sit around and let you drag my partner off to their very likely death!

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:01.980
(distorted) I thought I told you to stay out of my kitchen!

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:09.080
(distorted) A domain of evil this is... but in we must go.

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:15.680
(distorted) You first...

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:19.840
[music returns to normal, heartbeat remains]

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:08.480
Colonel: There you are! I've been meaning to ask you some questions–

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:12.960
What is this?

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:17.640
The detective's been keeping tabs on us?

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.720
The detective's been keeping tabs on me.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:23.880
And Celine!

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:27.700
He's the one who orchestrated ALL of this!

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:29.660
He DID this!

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.940
Detective!

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.800
DETECTIVE!

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:35.860
Where is he?

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.380
He took them from me...

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.860
He took my friends from ME.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.500
He took...Celine.

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:43.940
He took Damien!

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:45.340
Where is he?

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:46.940
WHERE IS HE?!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:50.140
DETECTIVE! Are you hiding him from me?!

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.500
He can't hide forever. GET OUT OF MY WAY!

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.240
DETECTIVE!

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.980
Detective: You'd better choose your next words carefully, Colonel.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:02.420
Colonel: Only my friends get to call me by that name, and you, sir, are NO friend of mine!

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.140
Detective: Well, you're one to talk about friends, you MURDERER! [thunder]

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.900
Colonel: I didn't kill anybody! This is MADNESS!

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:11.880
Detective: Oh, you wanna talk about madness? Madness is stealing your best friend's wife.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:17.280
Madness is squeezing him for cash to fund your own sick sexual exploits with that very woman–

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.000
Colonel: SHUT UP!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.900
Detective: Madness is plotting the death of your childhood friend because you can't handle the–

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:22.800
[gunshot, thunder]

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.200
[intense, droning music picks up]

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:30.740
[Gunshot]

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:37.940
[Colonel, distorted] It was an accident!

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.660
[crash]

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:43.780
[slow, distorted] I swear...

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.680
[Music begins, crescendos]

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.120
[Heartbeat begins]

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:57.400
[Distorted voice] Body: It's not fair, isn't it?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.600
[All sounds are echoed]

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:08.220
Damien: He took everything from us. He trapped us in here with this broken shell and no way out.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:12.360
Celine: It's true. This whole time I thought it was the house but...

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:14.420
I never thought he'd fall this far.

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.180
Damien: And we played right into his hands.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:20.560
He'd been planning this for years and now that son-of-a-bitch is out there walking around in MY body–

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:22.880
Celine: Damien, we CAN'T do this right now.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:26.820
Look, I know you have questions and I can't answer everything right now.

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:31.360
Just know that Mark took everything from us from his twisted quest of vengeance.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.420
But death does not mean the same thing here.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.040
Damien: What Celine means by that is..

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:40.380
This doesn't have to be the end.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:44.180
You're trapped in here just the same as us, but your body...

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:47.460
Broken as it may be, it's still out there.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.360
Celine: Mark's not the only one that can use this place to his benefit.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:56.200
The same way that I brought you here, is the same way that I can send you back.

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:59.400
Damien: But you can't survive on your own.

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:03.800
You're dead, after all. The Colonel saw to that.

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:06.820
Celine You can't blame him. Honestly, he's a good man.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.620
But he's dangerous now.

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:13.060
Damien: I know this all sounds crazy.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.940
Honestly, I don't know what the fuck is going on.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.000
But I know that I trust Celine.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.100
And if you trust us...

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:28.720
Just...let me in. [flicker] We can fix this. Together.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:32.660
Celine: I won't force this on you. You have a choice here.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.960
Just know this is the only way that you can escape.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.460
Just relax.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:43.460
Damien: This'll work. I promise.

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:48.800
[rumbling thunder]

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:57.960
[creaking noises]

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.080
Colonel: Oh no! No! It's okay.

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.300
I-I thought you were dead.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:13.760
I-I-I mean, of course you're not dead! You're not—how could you be dead?

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:17.700
I mean, I-I wouldn't have killed you. I-I didn't kill you.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:18.720
[Soft piano music starts]

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:20.780
I mean, of cour–I-I...

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:22.200
Of course!

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.940
I didn't kill anybody!

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.740
[laughter] I didn't-

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.860
It was all a joke!

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.320
Of course, it was all a joke!

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:33.320
Were you in on this!?

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:37.640
Did Damien put you up to this? Of course he did!

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:41.220
Damien, where are you, you rapscallion?

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:42.820
Where are you?

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:43.920
Celine?

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:46.860
Ah, it's time to come out now!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.360
AH!

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:52.100
It was good, it was good! You almost had me!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.180
[Slight warped] Ha! Ha, ha...Celine?

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.780
[Crackling, static noises]

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:04.140
[Slight static persists]

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:17.120
[Music ends on unfinished chord, fades out]

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:31.760
[loud static]

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:32.360
[short beep]

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.480
[coughing]

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.440
Detective: Colonel...

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.060
[coughing]

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.760
If you can hear this...

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.060
You better run.

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:44.700
[Radio turns off]

